
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PRIM_NAME: number = 27`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PRIM_NAME = 27;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_NAME has the value 27</p>
  <p>Used to get or set the prim's name.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>PrimParam</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>llSetPrimitiveParams</h2>
  <p><b> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetPrimitiveParams</a>(<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/String" target="_blank">&#32;PRIM_NAME,&#32;[string</a> name ]); </b></p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>• string</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/name" target="_blank">name</a></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>The same syntax applies to <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetLinkPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetLinkPrimitiveParams</a> and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetLinkPrimitiveParamsFast" target="_blank">llSetLinkPrimitiveParamsFast</a> but with an additional prefixed <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/link" target="_blank">link</a> parameter in the function call.</p>
  <p>There is no <b>llSetLinkName</b> function, using this flag this way fills that niche.</p>
  <h2>llGetPrimitiveParams</h2>
  <p><b> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llGetPrimitiveParams</a>([ PRIM_NAME ]); </b></p>
  <p>Returns the list <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/String" target="_blank"> [string</a> name ]</p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>• string</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/name" target="_blank">name</a></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>The same syntax applies to <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetLinkPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llGetLinkPrimitiveParams</a>, but with an additional prefixed <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/link" target="_blank">link</a> parameter in the function call.</p>
  <p>If <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/link" target="_blank">link</a> refers to an avatar (seated avatars are assigned link numbers), the avatar's <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Legacy_Name" target="_blank">legacy name</a> is returned.</p>
