  <h2>Examples</h2>
  <p>These are code fragments only</p>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

local NameOfThisPrim = ll.List2String(ll.GetPrimitiveParams({PRIM_NAME}), 0)`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string NameOfThisPrim = llList2String( llGetPrimitiveParams( [PRIM_NAME] ), 0);`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <p>In cases like this where a list only contains one entry, we can get away with a shortcut:-</p>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local NameOfThisPrim = tostring(ll.GetPrimitiveParams({PRIM_NAME}))`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string NameOfThisPrim = (string) llGetPrimitiveParams( [PRIM_NAME] );`} lang="lsl" /></div>
